{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the underground arena, where chaos meets competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on a mission, dig through destructible caves packed with minerals, power-ups, and rival moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources, outsmart your opponents, and deposit your minerals in this fast-paced party brawler for 2\u20138 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, blast, and jetpack your way through frantic matches as you race to fill the cart\u2014but watch out, rivals will do anything to steal your haul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig &amp; Destroy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunnel through dynamic, randomly generated maps where no two matches are the same. Shape the battlefield as you dig, fight, and sabotage your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Loadout, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match unique tools, gadgets. Master your favorite combo or counter your friends' strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=852 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaotic PvP Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle up to seven other moles in free-for-all or team-based brawls online. Outplay, out-smart, and out-mine your rivals in unpredictable underground arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Party Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and jump into fast-paced online matches with friends, bots or strangers. Mineral Madness supports full controller setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Entered The Madness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/19799cdcf52039343c1c7b9b6f9f7ca553113c11.jpg"},{"name":"Anything For The Mineral","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/f52a2119864b8781cd0f97eaef011ff3baff08f8.jpg"},{"name":"Mineral Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/2789d67129950ad7832f2b7b4935bb412978adba.jpg"},{"name":"Certified Mole!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/a47b08714a81f4870bfc8002480b908c273d0a06.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Shovel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/5c8e4e6c26883e84e8cadac1085fcebdd05e68b3.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Drill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/6fa79b94d27a9eee6de353e24addd039e8bd39bc.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Rocket","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/250ca320aadee43953e3870027a83560f323671d.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Magnetic Bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/c441f243bec11ab0cb76e8ece3b4fdb46f4c2a34.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Detonable Bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/30c3cdc0939f0bede07adc1cdef8e5e868f0a923.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock Jetpack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204560/a1ab76f50714702098aebd805312c72255bb8f01.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2204560?t=1766565219","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766565219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/5acb174767c3b988aabd35f7303c86645f157d01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766565219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/5acb174767c3b988aabd35f7303c86645f157d01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766565219","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/6cd7689a3f6104a4ff64e5b56de2fe9f.avif?t=1766565219\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the underground arena, where chaos meets competition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on a mission, dig through destructible caves packed with minerals, power-ups, and rival moles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources, outsmart your opponents, and deposit your minerals in this fast-paced party brawler for 2\u20138 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, blast, and jetpack your way through frantic matches as you race to fill the cart\u2014but watch out, rivals will do anything to steal your haul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig &amp; Destroy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunnel through dynamic, randomly generated maps where no two matches are the same. Shape the battlefield as you dig, fight, and sabotage your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/55fecffbb8d873b9fd869a12c3eb7191.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Loadout, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match unique tools, gadgets. Master your favorite combo or counter your friends' strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=852 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/24d5191065510de8b991bf657bfd3ac6.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaotic PvP Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle up to seven other moles in free-for-all or team-based brawls online. Outplay, out-smart, and out-mine your rivals in unpredictable underground arenas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Party Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and jump into fast-paced online matches with friends, bots or strangers. Mineral Madness supports full controller setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.poster.avif?t=1766565219\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.webm?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.mp4?t=1766565219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Whacky Mole Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204560/7e3de70a2808acbf98c74d9a28a07ec8dbc45e8b/header.jpg?t=1766565219","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Whacky Mole Studio AB. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2204560/1395983723/c615143137c50e643b8ef2b0910e42519c19d514/1762786459/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762796835","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2204560/1395983723